---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { addressLine, site } from '../data/site';

const updated = 'November 5, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy - Goat Garage Door Service"
	description="Read how Goat Garage Door Service collects, uses, and protects the personal information you submit through the service request form on our website."
>
	<PageHero
		title="Privacy"
		lead="What happens to the details you send with a service request."
		crumbs={[
			{ label: 'Home', href: '/' },
			{ label: 'Privacy' },
		]}
	/>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container prose" style="max-width: 760px;">
			<p><strong>Last Updated: {updated}</strong></p>

			<h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
			<p>Our website address is: <a href={site.domain}>{site.domain}</a></p>
			<p>
				We are {site.name}, a garage door service provider serving residential and commercial customers. This Privacy Policy
				explains what personal information may be collected when you visit our website, how that information may be used, and the
				choices available to you regarding your personal information.
			</p>
			<p>We respect your privacy and aim to handle personal information responsibly.</p>

			<h2>2. What Personal Data We Collect and Why</h2>

			<h3>Contact Forms</h3>
			<p>
				When you submit a contact form or request information through our website, we may collect personal information such as
				your name, email address, phone number, and the details of your message.
			</p>
			<p>
				We use this information to respond to inquiries, provide requested information, discuss garage door services, and
				communicate with you regarding your request.
			</p>
			<p>Please avoid submitting sensitive personal information through website forms.</p>
			<p>We do not use contact form information for unrelated marketing purposes unless you have provided the appropriate consent.</p>

			<h3>Cookies</h3>
			<p>Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to support website functionality and improve your browsing experience.</p>
			<p>
				Cookies may be used to remember user preferences, understand website usage, or support other features provided by the
				website and its integrations.
			</p>
			<p>
				You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings. However, disabling certain cookies may affect how parts
				of the website function.
			</p>

			<h3>Embedded Content</h3>
			<p>
				Some pages on our website may include embedded content from third-party websites, such as maps, videos, or other external
				content.
			</p>
			<p>
				Embedded content behaves in the same way as if you visited the third-party website directly. These external websites may
				collect information about you, use cookies, track your interactions, and monitor your activity according to their own
				privacy policies.
			</p>
			<p>We do not control the privacy practices of third-party websites.</p>

			<h2>3. Who We Share Your Data With</h2>
			<p>
				We may share limited information with third-party service providers when necessary to operate our website, respond to
				inquiries, maintain website security, or provide requested services.
			</p>
			<p>Depending on the tools and integrations actually used, these providers may include:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Website hosting and infrastructure providers.</li>
				<li>Email and communication service providers.</li>
				<li>Spam prevention and website security services.</li>
				<li>Other third-party services necessary for website functionality.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.</p>
			<p>Third-party providers may process information according to their own privacy policies and applicable terms.</p>

			<h2>4. How Long We Retain Your Data</h2>
			<p>
				We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was
				collected, respond to inquiries, maintain business records, meet legal obligations, and protect our legitimate interests.
			</p>
			<p>You may contact us to request information about the retention of your personal data.</p>

			<h2>5. What Rights You Have Over Your Data</h2>
			<p>Depending on applicable privacy laws, you may have the right to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you.</li>
				<li>Request a copy of your personal information.</li>
				<li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
				<li>Request deletion of your personal information.</li>
				<li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.</li>
				<li>Ask questions about how your information is collected and used.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>These rights may be subject to legal, security, and record-retention requirements.</p>
			<p>
				To make a privacy-related request, contact us using the information provided in the Contact Information section below.
			</p>

			<h2>6. Where We Send Your Data</h2>
			<p>
				Information submitted through our website may be processed by third-party service providers that help us operate the
				website and manage customer inquiries.
			</p>
			<p>
				Contact form submissions may be processed through website hosting, email delivery, or communication services used to
				receive and respond to inquiries.
			</p>
			<p>We do not claim to use any particular third-party processing service unless it is actually configured on our website.</p>

			<h2>7. Contact Information</h2>
			<p>
				If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, how your personal information is handled, or wish to make a
				privacy-related request, you can contact us using the following details:
			</p>
			<p><strong>Business Name:</strong> {site.name}</p>
			<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href={site.domain}>{site.domain}</a></p>
			<p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
			<p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href={`tel:${site.phoneTel}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a></p>
			<p><strong>Business Address:</strong> {addressLine}</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
